64	// perfectly legal JSON number carried by an unknown field — directly at the
65	// top of the plan, nested in unknown objects and arrays, or inside a change
66	// record — precedes a corrupt business name in every position that takes
67	// part in the adjustment (a change record's name, an upstreams entry, a
68	// removals entry). The corruption must still be reported, with the error
69	// naming the name defect rather than the number or a missing upstream.
